msgstr "Bring it back to Room 202 and press E to turn it in. Then I will open the way to 3F. Decide whether to accept the task."

msgid "独眼客 · 202"
msgstr "One-Eyed Guest · 202"

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n返回一楼在保安身后取证 → Q切为当前保安\n返回二楼保管柜按E领取 → 回202交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nReturn to 1F for the guard's ID → Q to make it active\nReturn to the 2F cabinet → E to collect → Room 202."

