msgid "重新挑战本任务，回202重新接受；201成果保留。"
msgstr "Retry and accept the task again at Room 202. Room 201 progress is kept."

msgid "前往202。"
msgstr "Go to Room 202."

msgid "201已交付；向右到202接包裹任务。"
msgstr "Room 201 complete. Head right to Room 202 for the parcel task."

msgid "先接受对应任务并切到所需当前身份；清理须长按 E，包裹柜按 E 领取。"
msgstr "Accept the task and activate the required ID first. Hold E to clean; press E at the cabinet to collect the parcel."

msgid "%s需要当前%s身份；按Q切换到对应工作证后通过。"
msgstr "Room %s requires the %s ID to be active. Press Q to switch to it before passing."

msgid "%s身份核对通过，可以继续前进。"
msgstr "Room %s: ID verified. You may continue."

msgid "包裹已领取，在202按E交付。"
msgstr "Parcel collected. Press E at Room 202 to turn it in."

msgid "202任务进行中：取得保安证，切为当前身份，再去保管柜领取包裹。"
msgstr "Room 202 task in progress: get the Security ID, make it active, then collect the parcel at the cabinet."

msgid "保管柜 · 当前保安身份 · E领取"
msgstr "Parcel cabinet · Security ID · E: Collect"

msgid "202包裹交付后开放后段"
msgstr "Turn in parcel at Room 202 to pass"

# A: Task03 manager approval, confirmed D-05/D-07.

msgid "202已交付；上3F到302接授权任务"
msgstr "Room 202 complete; go to Room 302 on 3F"

msgid "202已交付；从二楼右梯上3F，到302接受管理授权任务。"
msgstr "Room 202 complete. Take the right stairs to 3F and accept the approval task at Room 302."

msgid "302管理授权任务待接受：回1F取经理证，装备并切为当前身份，回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Room 302 · Approval task available. Read the details to accept."

msgid "309 · 先取得管理批准"
msgstr "Room 309 · Manager approval required"

msgid "309 · 取得管理批准后开放"
msgstr "Room 309 · Requires manager approval"

msgid "309尚未获准；先完成302的管理授权任务。"
msgstr "Room 309 is not approved. Complete the approval task from Room 302 first."

msgid "309登记台 · 当前经理身份 · E批准"
msgstr "309 register · Manager ID · E: Approve"

msgid "309登记已批准；任务03完成"
msgstr "Room 309 approved; Task 03 complete"

msgid "309登记已批准；任务03完成，救援后续尚未开放。"
msgstr "Room 309 approved; Task 03 complete. The rescue sequence is not available yet."

msgid "309登记已批准；救援后续尚未开放。"
msgstr "Room 309 approved. The rescue sequence is not available yet."

msgid "3F登记台按E批准309"
msgstr "3F register · E: Approve Room 309"

msgid "3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Press E at the register on 3F to approve Room 309."

msgid "I将经理证放入佩戴槽"
msgstr "I: Equip the Manager ID in a slot"

msgid "I将经理证放入佩戴槽。"
msgstr "Press I and equip the Manager ID in a slot."

msgid "Q切为经理，再回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Press Q to make Manager active, then use the register on 3F."

msgid "Q切为经理，回3F登记台批准"
msgstr "Q: Manager ID → 3F register"

msgid "任务已接受：回1F取经理证，I装备、Q切当前身份，再回3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Task accepted · Manager ID on 1F → I: Equip → Q: Activate → 3F register"

msgid "前往3F的302。"
msgstr "Go to Room 302 on 3F."

msgid "回1F取得经理证，装备并切为当前身份，再到3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Get the Manager ID on 1F, equip and activate it, then press E at the register on 3F."

msgid "回1F经理身后长按E取得工作证。"
msgstr "Hold E behind the manager on 1F to take the Manager ID."

msgid "回1F经理身后长按E取证"
msgstr "Hold E behind the manager on 1F"

msgid "回302重新接受；201／202成果保留"
msgstr "Retry at Room 302; keep Rooms 201/202"

msgid "回302重新接受；201／202成果保留。"
msgstr "Accept again at Room 302. Progress in Rooms 201 and 202 is kept."

msgid "回三楼，在309附近登记台按E批准；批准即完成任务并停表，不用回302交付。"
msgstr "Return to the register near Room 309 on 3F and press E to approve. Approval completes the task and stops the clock. No return to Room 302 is needed."

msgid "回到302接受前，保留201／202成果，撤销本任务经理卡与批准。"
msgstr "Return to before accepting at Room 302. Keep Rooms 201/202 progress; undo the Manager ID and approval gained during this task."

msgid "在302接受240秒授权任务"
msgstr "Accept the 240-second task at Room 302"

msgid "在302接受240秒授权任务。"
msgstr "Accept the 240-second approval task at Room 302."

msgid "我是302的住客。309的登记还没有得到管理批准。"
msgstr "I'm the guest in Room 302. Room 309 still needs the manager's approval."

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n回1F经理身后取证 → I装备／Q切当前经理\n回3F登记台按E批准即完成，不需回302交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nTake the manager's ID on 1F → I: Equip / Q: Activate\nE at the 3F register completes the task. No return to Room 302 needed."

msgid "打开背包，把经理证放进一个佩戴槽，再按Q切为当前经理身份。"
msgstr "Open the bag and put the Manager ID in an equipment slot. Then press Q to make it your active ID."

msgid "接受后有240秒。先回一楼，在经理身后长按E取得经理工作证。"
msgstr "You have 240 seconds after accepting. Return to 1F and hold E behind the manager to take the Manager ID."

msgid "礼帽客 · 302"
msgstr "Top-Hatted Guest · 302"

msgid "二楼教学已经完成。309仍有独立的登记限制，需要管理批准。"
msgstr "The 2F tutorial is complete. Room 309 still needs a separate management approval."

msgid "接受后有240秒。沿用已取得的经理工作证，不需要再次偷证。"
msgstr "You have 240 seconds after accepting. Use your existing Manager ID; you do not need to steal it again."

msgid "309登记 · 302"
msgstr "Room 309 Registration · 302"

msgid "202已交付；继续到203完成房务申请教学。"
msgstr "Room 202 delivered. Continue to Room 203 for the room-service tutorial."

msgid "沿用经理证，I装备／Q切当前经理 → 回3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Use your Manager ID · I: Equip / Q: Activate → E at the 3F register"

msgid "302管理授权任务待接受：沿用经理证，装备并切为当前身份，回3F登记台批准。"
msgstr "Room 302 task available: equip and activate your Manager ID, then use the 3F register."

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n沿用经理工作证 → I装备／Q切当前经理\n回3F登记台按E批准即完成，不需回302交付。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nUse your Manager ID → I: Equip / Q: Activate\nE at the 3F register completes the task. No return to Room 302 needed."

msgid "回到302接取前，保留前序任务和已有证件，仅撤销本次309批准。"
msgstr "Return to before accepting at Room 302. Keep earlier tasks and existing IDs; undo only this task’s Room 309 approval."

msgid "沿用已有经理证，装备并切为当前身份，再到3F登记台按E批准309。"
msgstr "Use your existing Manager ID, equip and activate it, then press E at the register on 3F."

msgid "202已交付；继续到203接房务申请任务"
msgstr "Room 202 delivered · Continue to Room 203 for the room-service task"
msgid "Terese"
msgstr "Terese"

msgid "309登记已批准；切为保洁身份进入309，寻找Terese。"
msgstr "Room 309 registration approved. Activate the Cleaner ID and enter Room 309 to find Terese."

msgid "Terese已同行，前往五楼消防出口。"
msgstr "Terese is with you. Head to the fire exit on 5F."

msgid "前往五楼消防出口，与Terese一起离开"
msgstr "Head to the fire exit on 5F and leave with Terese."

msgid "剩余时间 %02d:%02d"
msgstr "Time left %02d:%02d"

msgid "状态：%s"
msgstr "Status: %s"

msgid "切换工作证"
msgstr "Switch ID"

msgid "下一步：前往 %dF · %s"
msgstr "Next: Go to %dF · %s"

msgid "后续目标待主线接口提供"
msgstr "The next objective is awaiting story integration"

msgid "%s · %s · %s  %.2f / %.2f 秒"
msgstr "%s · %s · %s  %.2f / %.2f s"

msgid "%s：%s"
msgstr "%s: %s"

msgid "当前步骤未开放"
msgstr "This step is not available yet"

msgid "已取得%s工作证，请按当前任务目标继续。"
msgstr "You already have the %s ID. Continue with your current objective."

msgid "核验区内不能调整证件。先退到安全工作台，再按I换证。"
msgstr "You cannot change IDs in the inspection area. Move to a safe workstation first."

msgid "403需要巡房记录；换证不会放行。先取得记录，再回门前按E交付。"
msgstr "Room 403 needs the patrol record, not a different ID. Collect the record, then return and press E to deliver it."

msgid "礼帽客只认可经理身份。先在安全处切为当前经理，再经过。"
msgstr "The Top Hat Guest accepts a manager. Select that identity in a safe area before passing."

msgid "大耳客开门时请停下不动，等门关闭再走。换证不能代替静止。"
msgstr "Stand still while the Big Ear Guest’s door is open. Wait until it closes before moving."

msgid "核验客开门时不要在门前换证。先在安全处准备，保持身份经过。"
msgstr "Do not change ID near the Checker’s open door. Prepare in a safe area, then keep that identity."

msgid "登记已批准。切为保洁身份，去309按E开门。"
msgstr "Registration approved. Select Cleaner, then press E at Room 309."

msgid "当前身份不符"
msgstr "Wrong active identity"

msgid "开门时仍在移动"
msgstr "Moved while the door was open"

msgid "在核验区换证"
msgstr "Changed ID in the inspection area"

msgid "%s · %s。%s"
msgstr "%s · %s. %s"

msgid "%s · 背后站定\n按住E直到进度完成"
msgstr "%s · Stand behind them\nHold E until the bar fills"

msgid "%s · 正面会被发现\n站到背后标记，再按住E"
msgstr "%s · Their front is unsafe\nStand on the rear mark, then hold E"

msgid "309还未登记。用经理工作证，到本层登记台批准入住。"
msgstr "Room 309 is unregistered. Use Manager ID at this floor’s registration desk."

msgid "接受后限时240秒；批准即完成，不用回302交付。"
msgstr "You have 240 seconds after accepting. Approval completes it; no return to 302 is needed."

msgid "所需身份：%s · 接受后限时 %d 秒\n到本层登记台批准309入住，批准即完成。"
msgstr "Required: %s · %d seconds after accepting\nApprove Room 309 at this floor’s desk to complete the task."

msgid "已选%s：拖到A／B槽，或点装备按钮；原证保留。"
msgstr "Selected %s: drag to A/B, or use Equip."

msgid "收藏保留全部证件。拖到A／B槽，关闭后按Q切当前身份。"
msgstr "All cards stay collected. Drag one to A/B; close the bag and press Q to switch identity."

msgid "新证件在收藏中。按I打开背包，把它拖到A／B槽；原证件会保留。"
msgstr "Your new ID is in the collection. Press I and drag it to A/B. Replaced cards stay collected."

msgid "两个槽都已装备。关闭背包后按Q切当前身份；亮框表示生效的证件。"
msgstr "Both slots are equipped. Close the bag and press Q to switch. The bright frame marks your active ID."

msgid "已获得工作证！右上角显示当前身份。按I查看收藏与装备。"
msgstr "ID acquired! Your active identity is at the top right. Press I to view cards and equipment."

msgid "H：查看已学住客规则"
msgstr "H: review the guest rules you have learned"

msgid "当前身份：%s"
msgstr "Active identity: %s"

msgid "已装备%s到槽%s；全部证件仍在收藏。关闭背包后按Q切换身份。"
msgstr "Equipped %s in %s. Close bag, then Q to switch."

msgid "当前槽未装备。关闭背包后按Q启用另一槽的工作证。"
msgstr "Your active slot is empty. Close the bag and press Q to use the other slot’s ID."

msgid "已退回本层楼梯。%s：%s。%s"
msgstr "Returned to this floor’s stairs. %s: %s. %s"

msgid "◆ 生效"
msgstr "◆ Active"

msgid "二楼房务申请"
msgstr "2F Room Service Request"

msgid "清理与巡房记录"
msgstr "Cleaning and Patrol Record"

msgid "二楼通行备案"
msgstr "2F Passage Registration"

msgid "在%s接受任务，接受后限时180秒。"
msgstr "Accept the task in Room %s. The 180-second timer starts after acceptance."

msgid "重新挑战后回%s接受，救援和前序成果保留。"
msgstr "After retrying, return to Room %s and accept again. The rescue and earlier progress are kept."

msgid "在巡房员工身后站定，长按E偷取巡房记录。"
msgstr "Stand behind the patrol staff member and hold E to take the patrol log."

msgid "返回%s按E交付"
msgstr "Return to Room %s and press E to deliver."

msgid "403已交付；从右端楼梯上5F，在501接离店任务。"
msgstr "Room 403 is complete. Take the stairs at the right end to 5F and accept the exit task in Room 501."

msgid "切为当前经理身份，在五楼离店登记台按E批准。"
msgstr "Activate the Manager ID, then press E at the 5F exit register to approve the form."

msgid "Terese已同行；前往4F403取得并交付巡房记录。"
msgstr "Terese is with you. Go to Room 403 on 4F, collect the patrol log, and deliver it."

msgid "403已交付；前往5F501办理并交付离店单。"
msgstr "Room 403 is complete. Go to Room 501 on 5F to approve and deliver the exit form."

msgid "离店单已交付；前往五楼消防出口按E逃离。"
msgstr "The exit form is delivered. Go to the 5F fire exit and press E to escape."

msgid "巡房记录已取得，返回403按E交付；交付前仍会计时。"
msgstr "Record collected. Return to Room 403 to deliver."

msgid "巡房记录已取得，在403按E交付；不需要切换身份。"
msgstr "Patrol record collected. Press E at Room 403 to deliver; no ID change is needed."

msgid "独眼客"
msgstr "One-Eyed Guest"

msgid "礼帽客"
msgstr "Top-Hat Guest"

msgid "大耳客"
msgstr "Big-Eared Guest"

msgid "核验客"
msgstr "Verifier"

msgid "停、停！别再往前踩了。"
msgstr "Stop, stop! Don't take another step."

msgid "怎么了？"
msgstr "What's wrong?"

msgid "这股味道……你没闻见？地毯都脏成这样了！"
msgstr "That smell... Can't you smell it? This carpet is filthy!"

msgid "我只是来找人的。"
msgstr "I'm just looking for someone."

msgid "找人也不能踩着脏东西到处走。让负责清洁的人来。"
msgstr "Then don't track dirt everywhere. Bring someone who cleans."

msgid "清理干净，你就让我过去？"
msgstr "If I clean it, will you let me through?"

msgid "先打扫，再回来让我闻闻。别拿工作证晃一下就想走。"
msgstr "Clean first. Then come back so I can smell. Waving an ID won't do."

msgid "清洁的人呢？这股味道，我一刻都受不了了。"
msgstr "Where's the cleaner? I can't stand this smell another moment."

msgid "得先拿到保洁员的工作证。"
msgstr "I need to get the housekeeper's ID first."

msgid "证是有了，地毯可还脏着。"
msgstr "You have the ID. The carpet is still dirty."

msgid "去打扫。鼻子可不会看错。"
msgstr "Go clean it. My nose doesn't lie."

msgid "污渍已清理，返回 201 向长鼻客交付。"
msgstr "Stain cleaned. Return to Room 201 to deliver the work."

msgid "已经清理干净了。"
msgstr "I've cleaned it."

msgid "嗯……等等。"
msgstr "Hmm... Wait."

msgid "没有了。那股难闻的味道，总算没有了。"
msgstr "Gone. That awful smell is finally gone."

msgid "现在可以过去了吗？"
msgstr "Can I go through now?"

msgid "走吧，走吧。鞋底也注意一点。"
msgstr "Go on. Watch your shoes, too."

msgid "刚打扫好的，别再弄脏。"
msgstr "It's freshly cleaned. Don't dirty it again."

msgid "站住。你从保管柜那边过来的？"
msgstr "Stop. Did you come from the storage cabinet?"

msgid "没有，我刚上来。"
msgstr "No. I just got here."

msgid "我的包裹还在里面。替我拿来。"
msgstr "My parcel is in there. Bring it to me."

msgid "为什么不自己去？"
msgstr "Why not get it yourself?"

msgid "柜子只认保安权限。你去想办法。"
msgstr "The cabinet requires security clearance. Work it out."

msgid "拿来以后，你就让我过去？"
msgstr "Bring it back, and you'll let me through?"

msgid "东西完整地送到我手上，再谈。"
msgstr "Bring it to me intact. Then we'll talk."

msgid "没权限，柜子就不会开。还有什么不明白的？"
msgstr "No clearance, no access. What's unclear?"

msgid "工作证我看见了。包裹呢？"
msgstr "I see the ID. Where's the parcel?"

msgid "已取得包裹，返回 202 交付。"
msgstr "Parcel collected. Return to Room 202 to deliver it."

msgid "你的包裹。"
msgstr "Your parcel."

msgid "放这儿。让我看看。"
msgstr "Put it here. Let me see."

msgid "封条没动，编号也对。"
msgstr "Seal intact. Number matches."

msgid "检查完了？"
msgstr "Finished checking?"

msgid "完了。你可以走了。"
msgstr "Yes. You can go."

msgid "东西收到了。别再碰那个柜子。"
msgstr "Received. Leave that cabinet alone."

msgid "请稍候。我的房务申请，似乎还没有得到答复。"
msgstr "One moment, please. My room-service request is still unanswered."

msgid "我不是来处理房务的。"
msgstr "I'm not here to handle room service."

msgid "那真遗憾。这条通道，目前恐怕不便开放。"
msgstr "How unfortunate. I'm afraid this passage cannot open yet."

msgid "要怎样你才肯让我过去？"
msgstr "What will it take to let me through?"

msgid "请找一位有管理权限的人，到二楼登记台批准申请。"
msgstr "Please find someone with management clearance to approve it at the 2F desk."

msgid "然后回来告诉你？"
msgstr "Then come back and tell you?"

msgid "劳烦您了。手续齐全，大家都方便。"
msgstr "Much obliged. Proper paperwork makes everything easier."

msgid "恐怕还需要经理的权限。普通员工无法代签。"
msgstr "I'm afraid manager clearance is required. Other staff cannot sign."

msgid "身份没有问题。不过，申请仍在等待批准。"
msgstr "Your clearance is sufficient. The request still awaits approval."

msgid "房务申请已批准，返回 203 回复礼帽客。"
msgstr "Request approved. Return to Room 203 to report back."

msgid "你的申请已经批准了。"
msgstr "Your request has been approved."

msgid "如此甚好。让我确认一下。"
msgstr "Excellent. Allow me to confirm."

msgid "手续齐全，多谢您费心。"
msgstr "All in order. Thank you for your trouble."

msgid "那这条路……"
msgstr "Then the passage..."

msgid "自然。请便。"
msgstr "Of course. Please proceed."

msgid "事情办得很妥当。祝您今晚顺利。"
msgstr "Very well handled. May your evening go smoothly."

msgid "嘘。先别走。"
msgstr "Shh. Don't go yet."

msgid "你听见什么了？"
msgstr "What did you hear?"

msgid "鞋底拖过脏地毯的声音。来回，来回……一直不停。"
msgstr "Soles dragging over dirty carpet. Back and forth. It never stops."

msgid "你想让我打扫？"
msgstr "You want me to clean it?"

msgid "把那一处清理掉。还有，拿今晚的巡房记录来。"
msgstr "Clean that spot. And bring tonight's patrol log."

msgid "巡房记录在哪里？"
msgstr "Where is the patrol log?"

msgid "二楼的资料柜。保安才能领。"
msgstr "The 2F records cabinet. Only security can collect it."

msgid "先打扫，再去拿记录。对吗？"
msgstr "Clean first, then collect the log. Right?"

msgid "对。回来时，轻一点。"
msgstr "Yes. Be quiet on your way back."

msgid "本任务需要保洁和保安两种身份，请在背包中准备对应的两个装备槽。"
msgstr "Prepare Housekeeper and Security IDs in the two equipped slots."

msgid "那一处还没干净。脚步经过，我听得见。"
msgstr "That spot is still dirty. I hear every footstep over it."

msgid "走廊安静些了。"
msgstr "The corridor is quieter."

msgid "巡房记录呢？我要知道，今晚还有谁会经过。"
msgstr "The patrol log? I need to know who will pass tonight."

msgid "记录先拿好。走廊那一处，还没处理完。"
msgstr "Keep the log safe. That spot still needs cleaning."

msgid "清理与取件均已完成，返回 204 交付巡房记录。"
msgstr "Both jobs are done. Return to Room 204 to deliver the patrol log."

msgid "清理好了。巡房记录也拿来了。"
msgstr "It's clean. I brought the patrol log, too."

msgid "纸放下。慢一点。"
msgstr "Put the paper down. Slowly."

msgid "嗯……今晚的安排，都在这里。"
msgstr "Hmm... Tonight's schedule. It's all here."

msgid "我可以过去了？"
msgstr "Can I go through?"

msgid "可以。门开着的时候，记得停下脚步。"
msgstr "Yes. Remember to stand still when the door is open."

msgid "我听得见。轻一点就好。"
msgstr "I can hear you. Just be gentle."

msgid "停止通行。备案未完成。"
msgstr "Stop. Transit registration incomplete."

msgid "还需要什么？"
msgstr "What else is required?"

msgid "两项。领取通行单，完成管理批准。"
msgstr "Two items. Collect the form. Obtain management approval."

msgid "去哪里领？"
msgstr "Where do I collect it?"

msgid "二楼值班资料点。领取需要保安权限。"
msgstr "The 2F duty records point. Security clearance required."

msgid "批准要用经理身份？"
msgstr "Manager identity for approval?"

msgid "正确。办理完毕后，返回核验。"
msgstr "Correct. Return for verification when complete."

msgid "明白了。"
msgstr "Understood."

msgid "证件提前准备。核验期间，不得更换。"
msgstr "Prepare your IDs in advance. No switching during verification."

msgid "本任务需要保安和经理两种身份，请调整两个装备槽。"
msgstr "Prepare Security and Manager IDs in the two equipped slots."

msgid "第一项未完成。请先领取通行单。"
msgstr "Item one incomplete. Collect the transit form first."

msgid "文件已领取。"
msgstr "Document collected."

msgid "管理批准缺失。请前往登记台。"
msgstr "Management approval missing. Proceed to the registration desk."

msgid "批准通行单需要当前生效身份为经理。"
msgstr "Approving the form requires Manager as the active identity."

msgid "通行单已批准，返回 205 交付核验。"
msgstr "Transit form approved. Return to Room 205 for verification."

msgid "这是批准后的通行单。"
msgstr "Here is the approved form."

msgid "文件编号一致。"
msgstr "Document number matches."

msgid "管理批准有效。"
msgstr "Management approval valid."

msgid "备案完成，允许通行。"
msgstr "Registration complete. Passage allowed."

msgid "总算能继续往三楼走了。"
msgstr "At last. I can continue toward the third floor."

msgid "已完成核验，无须重复提交。"
msgstr "Verification complete. Do not submit again."

msgid "背包"
msgstr "Bag"

msgid "笔记"
msgstr "Notes"

msgid "暂停"
msgstr "Pause"

msgid "任务"
msgstr "Tasks"

msgid "点击对话框或按 E"
msgstr "Click the dialogue box or press E"

msgid "站住！你的手刚才伸到哪儿去了？"
msgstr "Stop! Where do you think that hand was going?"

msgid "偷工作证？我看得清清楚楚，别想蒙混过去！"
msgstr "Stealing a staff ID? I saw that. Don't try to talk your way out!"

msgid "糟了……偏偏这时候看过来！"
msgstr "Great... You had to look over right then!"

msgid "还想跑？把手放好，跟我去门口。你得离开这家旅馆！"
msgstr "Trying to run? Hands where I can see them. To the door. You're leaving this hotel!"

msgid "哎！你往我口袋里摸什么呢？！"
msgstr "Hey! What are you doing with your hand in my pocket?!"

msgid "我忙着收拾房间，你倒忙着顺走我的工作证？"
msgstr "I'm busy cleaning rooms, and you're busy pinching my staff ID?"

msgid "不是，我……啧，被看见了。"
msgstr "No, I... Tch. Caught me."

msgid "少来这套！门在那边，赶紧出去，别等我叫保安！"
msgstr "Save it! The door's over there. Out, before I call security!"

msgid "……把手拿开。那是我的工作证。"
msgstr "...Hands off. That is my staff ID."

msgid "我原以为你是来办理手续的。看来，是我高估了你的礼貌。"
msgstr "I thought you were here for the paperwork. I seem to have overestimated your manners."

msgid "如果我说拿错了……你也不会信吧。"
msgstr "You wouldn't believe me if I said it was a mistake... would you?"

msgid "正确。偷窃者不在我们的接待范围内。请立即离开，否则我会请保安送你出去。"
msgstr "Correct. We do not accommodate thieves. Leave now, or security will escort you out."

msgid "Carol又拨了一次，电话里依然只有“对方暂时无法接听”的提示。她退出通话，翻出几天前收到的兼职录取通知。"
msgstr "Carol calls again, but the same message answers: “The person you are calling is unavailable.” She ends the call and opens the part-time job offer she received a few days ago."

msgid "几天前的傍晚，咖啡馆里。两杯饮料摆在桌上，Terese把手机递给Carol。"
msgstr "A few evenings earlier, at a cafe. Two drinks sit on the table as Terese hands her phone to Carol."

msgid "Terese笑着靠回卡座。录取通知上的那行小字，却让Carol放不下心。"
msgstr "Terese leans back with a smile. But the small print on the job offer still worries Carol."

msgid "Carol翻出聊天记录里的地址，拿起外套和钥匙。"
msgstr "Carol finds the address in their chat history and picks up her coat and keys."

msgid "雨幕中，旅馆的大门透出一片暖黄的灯光。"
msgstr "Through the rain, warm amber light spills from the hotel entrance."

msgid "楼上传来一声关门声。Carol转头望向楼梯。"
msgstr "A door shuts upstairs. Carol turns toward the stairs."

msgid "身上只能同时挂两张证……倒是挺会限制人的。"
msgstr "Only two IDs at a time... Of course there's a limit."

msgid "背包里还有位置，以后再拿到的证，就先收在那里。"
msgstr "There's still room in my bag. Any extra IDs can go there."

msgid "要换成别的身份，就打开背包，把要用的证换到装备栏里。"
msgstr "If I need a different identity, I'll open the bag and swap it into an equipment slot."

msgid "身上这两张倒不用来回摘。按{switch_key}就能切换，亮着的那张才算数。行，记住了。"
msgstr "For these two, I can just press {switch_key}. The highlighted ID is the active one. Fine. Got it."

msgid "……时间到了？啧，还是慢了一步。"
msgstr "...Time's up? Tch. A little too slow."

msgid "事情还没办完……得先把路线理清楚，不能再乱跑了。"
msgstr "The job isn't finished... I need a clear route. No more running around."

msgid "明明已经做完了，却没赶上交付。下次得把回去的时间也算进去。"
msgstr "I finished the job, but missed the hand-in. Next time, I'll leave enough time to get back."

msgid "不行，不能就这么算了。再来一次，这回得把路线记牢。"
msgstr "No. I'm not giving up here. One more try. This time, I'll remember the route."

msgid "多拿到的工作证可以收在背包里，要用时再换上。"
